+# Turn Usage Arithmetic
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#93 |
+| Status | Shipped              |
+
+This spec covers the pure arithmetic used to combine reported provider usage. It also defines how missing reports affect accumulation; hook integration remains governed by the config hooks spec and the ticket's acceptance tests.
+
+## Reported token counts
+
+- Combining reported usage adds each field independently across provider calls, including the provider's own `totalTokens` rather than recomputing it from input and output counts ([validated by: sums each reported token field across three provider calls](../../src/orchestration/turnUsage.test.ts#L4)).
+
+- Missing round usage leaves the accumulated counts unchanged, the first reported round supplies the initial counts, and a turn with no reported usage remains `undefined` ([validated by: counts reported usage across gaps and leaves unreported turns undefined](../../src/orchestration/turnUsageMissing.test.ts#L4)).
+
+- The final hook total includes usage from the tool request as well as the final provider response ([validated by: includes the tool request usage in the final hook total](../../src/orchestration/turnUsageHook.test.ts#L22)).
